blocks.en:
Defender’s setting. The defender receives a fine-tuned model suspected of containing a backdoor and aims to purify it before deployment.
We assume the defender only has access to:
(i) the pretrained adapter weights 𝐖 pre \mathbf{W}_{\text{pre}} , which are publicly available;
(ii) the suspected backdoored adapter weights 𝐖 bd \mathbf{W}_{\text{bd}} ;
and (iii) a small set of clean samples.

blocks.zh:
维权者的设置。 维权者接收了被怀疑有后门的微调型号并打算在部署前进行净化.
我们假设辩护人只能接触:
(一) 预训适配器重W pre\ mathbf{W}_{\text{pre}}},可公开使用;
(二) 疑似后门适配器重量W bd\ mathbf{W}_{\text{bd};
和(三)一小组清洁样品。

blocks.en:
Defense baselines. We compare against four defense methods:
Clean Fine-tuning, which continues fine-tuning the backdoored model on clean data;
Fine-Pruning ( Liu et al., 2018 ) , which prunes dormant neurons and then fine-tunes;
ANP ( Wu & Wang, 2021 ) , which identifies and prunes backdoor-sensitive neurons via adversarial perturbation;
and CLP ( Zheng et al., 2022 ) , which prunes channels with high spectral norm.
Since these methods were originally designed for image classifiers, we adapt them to the LVLM setting and provide sufficient clean data and computation to ensure a fair comparison. Detailed configurations are provided in Appendix C.4 .

blocks.zh:
防御基线。 我们比较了四种防御方法:
清洁精细调整,继续精细调整清洁数据的后门模型;
fine-Pruning (Liu等,2018年),它会先由休眠神经元分泌后再进行微调;
ANP (Wu & Wang, 2021),通过对抗性扰动识别并穿透后门敏感神经元;
和CLP(Zheng等人,2022年),它通过高光谱规范的通航道.
由于这些方法最初是为图像分级者设计的,因此我们根据LVLM设置加以调整,并提供足够的干净数据和计算,以确保公平比较. 附录C.4提供了详细的配置。
